'''Affliction Charges''' are alternative [[charge]]s of {{stl|Frenzy Charge}}. They are currently only granted by {{il|Olesya's Delight}}'s mod {{c|mod|Gain Affliction Charges instead of Frenzy Charges}}. Players can accumulate them the same way they generate frenzy charges.
==Related unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s are related to affliction charge:

{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
